  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A magical enhancement attached to an implement of magic allows spells fired to strike more accurately. Spell attacks with this magical implement gain a +2 item bonus, and the implement can be etched with one spell property rune.</p><p>You can upgrade the spell potency rune already etched on an implement to a stronger version, increasing the values of the existing rune to those of the new rune. You must have the formula of the stronger rune to do so, and the Price of the upgrade is the difference between the two runes' Prices.</p><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> You are an expert in Crafting.</p>"
